  "details": "FRRouting is free software that manages TCP/IP based routing protocols. It takes a multi-server and multi-threaded approach to resolve the current complexity of the Internet. FRRouting supports BGP4, OSPFv2, OSPFv3, ISIS, RIP, RIPng, PIM, NHRP, PBR, EIGRP and BFD. FRRouting is a fork of Quagga.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * frr: denial of service via crafted FlowSpec component (CVE-2026-37457)\n  * frr: denial of service via crafted BGP UPDATE message (CVE-2026-37459)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
